This is an add-on for Create Fly. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by
ZurrTum or the Create team.

Builds on
---------
- Create by simibubi and the Create team, MIT
- Create Fly by ZurrTum, CC0-1.0

Every class in this mod is this project's own. It changes Create's track
placement and train behaviour at runtime through mixins and redistributes no
Create Fly class, texture or translation. Create's own text is referenced by
translation key only.

